    "Decoration (engraved or printed) comes from the BigCommerce custom field dp_engraved.",
    "Engraved plastic colors like 'Black-Tan' are read as plate color first, engraving color second.",
    "Layout coordinates are read as box centers; with that reading layouts 1 to 7 match the 7 layout thumbnails in the live builder screenshot.",
    "The layouts' content box (679 x 329 canvas px) is mapped onto each badge's printable area (badge minus frame and a 0.08 in margin).",
    "'scene:lapel' is a new preview (badge worn on a shirt) that still has to be built."
  ],
